      "content": "hey do u know anything about hydroponic systems? my neighbor has this huge setup in their backyard and the misting cycles are constant. every time they spray it, there's this really heavy, sweet smell that gets into my house and it's making me feel super lightheaded and weird. is there a way to neutralize whatever particulates are in that mist so it doesn't get into my air?",
